!Series_summary	"We performed single-cell RNA/VDJ-sequencing of sorted T cells from post-treatment blood of patients with HPV-unrelated head and neck squamous cell carcinoma treated with either bintrafusp alfa alone or in combination with Tri-Ad5 vaccine. These patients are identical to the patients from which tumor-infiltrating T cells were isolated as reflected in the sample names."
