!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1	"Cells were mixed with barcoded gelbeads and 5′ GEM Kit v2 reagents (10X Genomics), and single-cell capture was performed. Following reverse transcription, cDNA was amplified, and gene expression libraries were constructed according to the manufacturer’s recommendations. Each fragmented DNA library was loaded into a sequencing lane on a NovaSeq 6000 system (Illumina) and was sequenced with pair-end reads of 75 bp."	"Cells were mixed with barcoded gelbeads and 5′ GEM Kit v2 reagents (10X Genomics), and single-cell capture was performed. Following reverse transcription, cDNA was amplified, and gene expression libraries were constructed according to the manufacturer’s recommendations. Each fragmented DNA library was loaded into a sequencing lane on a NovaSeq 6000 system (Illumina) and was sequenced with pair-end reads of 75 bp."	"Cells were mixed with barcoded gelbeads and 5′ GEM Kit v2 reagents (10X Genomics), and single-cell capture was performed. Following reverse transcription, cDNA was amplified, and gene expression libraries were constructed according to the manufacturer’s recommendations. Each fragmented DNA library was loaded into a sequencing lane on a NovaSeq 6000 system (Illumina) and was sequenced with pair-end reads of 75 bp."	"Cells were mixed with barcoded gelbeads and 5′ GEM Kit v2 reagents (10X Genomics), and single-cell capture was performed. Following reverse transcription, cDNA was amplified, and gene expression libraries were constructed according to the manufacturer’s recommendations. Each fragmented DNA library was loaded into a sequencing lane on a NovaSeq 6000 system (Illumina) and was sequenced with pair-end reads of 75 bp."	"Cells were mixed with barcoded gelbeads and 5′ GEM Kit v2 reagents (10X Genomics), and single-cell capture was performed. Following reverse transcription, cDNA was amplified, and gene expression libraries were constructed according to the manufacturer’s recommendations. Each fragmented DNA lib